What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/blk_q2c_wait
What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/blk_q2i_wait
What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/blk_i2d_wait
What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/blk_d2c_wait
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
	Read-only OnePlus Health Monitor request-latency counters for queue to
	completion, queue to insertion, insertion to dispatch, and dispatch to
	completion. Each node also reports the donor's eight most recent long
	wait records. Monitoring is enabled by the OHM control mask, matching
	the Android 14 OnePlus 9R production configuration.

What:		/sys/module/blk_monitor/parameters/{q2c,q2i,i2d,d2c}_wait_{high,low}_ms
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
	Root-writable high and low latency thresholds for each block request
	interval. Donor defaults are 500 ms and 200 ms respectively.
